{"id":"voluntad","lemma":"voluntad","pos":"noun","rank":1213,"glosses":["will, wish, want, desire","willpower"],"ipa":"/bolunˈtad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"voluntades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-voluntad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hice el trabajo en contra de mi voluntad.","en":"I did the work against my will.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706400","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"},null,null,null,{"g":"my"},null],"phrases":[[3,6,"against"]]},{"text":"Él tiene una fuerte voluntad.","en":"He has a strong will.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"strong"},null]},{"text":"Ella lo hizo contra su voluntad.","en":"She did it against her will.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Tom perdió la voluntad de vivir.","en":"Tom has lost the will to live.","words":[null,{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to live"}]},{"text":"Tienes mucha fuerza de voluntad.","en":"You've got a lot of willpower.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"force"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}